WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.067 line:92%
-Now, here's how it works.

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.469
We're going to have a normal
conversation with each other

00:00:02.469 --> 00:00:04.871
except every so often, we're
going to hear this "ding" sound.

00:00:04.871 --> 00:00:06.106 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Ding ]
And when we hear that,

00:00:06.106 --> 00:00:08.008 align:start size:94% position:6%
we'll be given
an emotion or situation

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:10.944 align:start size:94% position:6%
that we have to act out
as we keep talking.

00:00:10.944 --> 00:00:12.379 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
-Sound good?

00:00:12.379 --> 00:00:13.646 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Alright, here we go.

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:16.082 align:start size:94% position:6%
Alright. It's the first week
of October.

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:18.885 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you already have
Halloween plans?

00:00:18.885 --> 00:00:21.021 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Ding ]

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:22.589 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-Why are you asking?

00:00:22.589 --> 00:00:25.091 line:92%
-Why -- Why are you asking

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:27.093 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-I'm ask-- You came --

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:28.528 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Why would you do that?

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:30.663 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's Halloween.
So you dress up, right?

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:32.198 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Is that what you do?

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:33.800 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you get candy?
-Do you dress up?

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.168 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Do you get can--

00:00:35.168 --> 00:00:36.469 size:78% position:39% line:92%
You get candy, right?

00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:39.973 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Ca-- Is that like a code word
for something else?

00:00:39.973 --> 00:00:41.241 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.241 --> 00:00:43.676 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Do you give candy,
or do you get candy?

00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:45.412 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I --

00:00:45.412 --> 00:00:47.047 align:start size:94% position:6%
I take it.
-Yeah.

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:48.715 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Ding ]
Yeah.

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:50.216 size:75% position:38% line:92%
You do? You take it?

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:52.519 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.519 --> 00:00:53.820 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-I can't believe it!

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:56.122 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I know, there's
all sorts of candies!

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:57.724 line:92%
You get uh, uh, chocolate bars

00:00:57.724 --> 00:00:59.426 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Chocolate bars?
I love chocolate bars!

00:00:59.426 --> 00:01:01.561 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I love it, too!
-What kind do you love?

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:02.929 line:92%
-I love -- I love Hershey bars

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:04.831 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my goodness!
That's one of my favorites

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:06.132 line:92%
-Oh, my God! Are you serious

00:01:06.132 --> 00:01:07.600 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my goodness!
You say "serious"!

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:09.602 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my gosh!
I said the word "serious"!

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:10.970
-Oh, my God! You said "serious"!
[ Ding ]

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:12.105 line:92%
-I've never said that before

00:01:12.105 --> 00:01:14.941 line:92%
But I'm good at being serious.

00:01:14.941 --> 00:01:16.276 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.276 --> 00:01:17.944 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And I'm focused,

00:01:17.944 --> 00:01:21.948 size:81% position:41% line:92%
and I'm a team player.

00:01:21.948 --> 00:01:24.651 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, so am I.

00:01:24.651 --> 00:01:30.590 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think I'm very eligible
for Halloween.

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:32.559 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
And --

00:01:32.559 --> 00:01:35.128 size:78% position:39%
-I can wear all sorts
of costumes if you --

00:01:35.128 --> 00:01:38.098
or none -- none if you don't
want me to wear a costume.

00:01:38.098 --> 00:01:39.232 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I'm flexible --

00:01:39.232 --> 00:01:40.733 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Ding ]
Either way and --

00:01:40.733 --> 00:01:44.204 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Shakily ] And if I --

00:01:44.204 --> 00:01:45.939 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
If I dress up --

00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:47.507 align:start size:94% position:6%
If I dress up --
-Go ahead.

00:01:47.507 --> 00:01:50.143 align:start size:94% position:6%
-If I dress up as SpongeBob --
-Oh, my God.

00:01:50.143 --> 00:01:51.744 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
SpongeBob?

00:01:51.744 --> 00:01:53.046 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Yeah, if I dress up --

00:01:53.046 --> 00:01:55.281 size:78% position:39%
-You know, I just --
I just need a second.

00:01:55.281 --> 00:01:59.185 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because I can't believe it
that I'm here with you.

00:01:59.185 --> 00:02:02.388
And I just -- Oh, my God!
Don't touch me right now!

00:02:02.388 --> 00:02:04.457 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
[ Ding ]

00:02:04.457 --> 00:02:08.328 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh, you don't --
You don't want me to touch you

00:02:08.328 --> 00:02:09.195 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:13.032 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I just feel like
maybe it wouldn't be right

00:02:13.032 --> 00:02:14.901 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I thought, like,
maybe you were, like, getting,

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:17.337 align:start size:94% position:6%
you know, too emotional
about the holiday.

00:02:17.337 --> 00:02:18.438 align:start size:94% position:6%
So maybe?
-Yeah --

00:02:18.438 --> 00:02:20.240 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I thought
maybe I could comfort you.

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:20.874 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-That's possible.

00:02:20.874 --> 00:02:27.313
But, you know, I feel like
sometimes you should ask, maybe?

00:02:27.313 --> 00:02:28.214 align:start size:94% position:6%
Before --
[ Ding ]

00:02:28.214 --> 00:02:31.451 line:92%
-Do I have to? Because when --

00:02:31.451 --> 00:02:33.419 size:88% position:44% line:92%
In this society, 2019...

00:02:33.419 --> 00:02:34.621 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.621 --> 00:02:37.423 align:start size:94% position:6%
...you know, men, women,
are they the same?

00:02:37.423 --> 00:02:40.226 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do they get paid the same?
No. That's not fair.

00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:41.995 line:92%
How about this? Switch roles

00:02:41.995 --> 00:02:45.899 align:start size:94% position:6%
How about walk a mile in
my shoes, maybe for a weekend?

00:02:45.899 --> 00:02:48.701 line:92%
No, literally, get in my shoes

00:02:48.701 --> 00:02:53.873 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Because there are
about 75,000 people

00:02:53.873 --> 00:02:58.678
that we know of on this bloc
alone who do not have shoes.

00:02:58.678 --> 00:03:00.113 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
And --

00:03:00.113 --> 00:03:02.549 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Ding ]

00:03:02.549 --> 00:03:04.384 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Well, la-di-da.

00:03:04.384 --> 00:03:06.819 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.819 --> 00:03:07.520 size:75% position:38% line:92%
[ Ding, ding, ding ]

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:10.190 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's it right there.
We did it.

00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:10.757 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
That was fun.

00:03:10.757 --> 00:03:12.959 align:start size:94% position:6%
That was an emotional intervie
with Lupita Nyong'o.

